<title>ANTIGUA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES V INDIA FOURTH TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES V INDIA FOURTH TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOHN'S, Antigua 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the</p>
<p>fourth day of the fourth test between West Indies and India on</p>
<p>Monday:</p>
<p>West Indies first innings</p>
<p> S.Campbell run out			  10</p>
<p> S.Williams c Tendulkar b Kuruvilla     0</p>
<p> S.Chanderpaul c Laxman b Kumble	 24</p>
<p> B.Lara c Mongia b Prasad		 103</p>
<p> C.Hooper c Azharuddin b Joshi	   26</p>
<p> R.Holder c Mongia b Kumble		56</p>
<p> C.Browne not out			     4</p>
<p> I.Bishop c Dravid b Joshi		 17</p>
<p> Extras (lb 5 nb 7)			  12</p>
<p> Total (for seven wickets)		252</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-0 2-32 3-40 4-82 5-224 6-230 7-252</p>
<p>To bat: C.Ambrose, F.Rose, C.Walsh.</p>
<p>Bowling (to date): Prasad 19-4-43-1, Kuruvilla 17-1-50-1,</p>
<p>Kumble 31-13-66-2, Joshi 19.3-6-64-2, Ganguly 3-0-24-0.</p>
<p>India: VVS Laxman, Ajay Jadeja, Rahul Dravid, Sachin</p>
<p>Tendulkar (captain), Saurav Ganguly, Mohammad Azharuddin, Nayan</p>
<p>Mongia, Anil Kumble, Sunil Joshi, Abey Kuruvilla, Venkatesh</p>
<p>Prasad.</p>
